{
  "ghi_chu": "Me thoi hien dai (Phase 8B). Thuoc cua manh city-kit: ti_le = min(1.53, 1.9/day, 2.33/cao) - 1.53 la thuoc chung (o luoi Kenney rong 1 don vi, o luoi game rong 2, da tru hao cho vua MOT trang atlas 2x), hai ve sau chi chan cai qua kho. CAM chuan hoa tung model ve cung mot day: lam vay thi thung rac to bang can nha. Nguoi cua Kenney mini-characters la kieu dau to (chibi) cao 0.67 don vi. Ti_le 1.0 cho sprite 2x co 111x92 diem anh; nguoi me trung co la 116x107. Nho hon MOT CHUT la co y: dau chibi lam nguoi trong to hon so do thuc, chu du an bao \"nguoi to qua\" o ti_le 1.25 (131x113). Cay coi va da lay nguyen phan qn cua trung_co_2: rung khong doi theo thoi dai. Nguon: Kenney City Kit Suburban/Commercial/Industrial/Roads + Kenney Mini Characters (CC0) - tien to ks/kc/ki/kr/mn. Trang atlas 2x la thu bi chan: me trung co lap day 84,4% mot trang, me nay phai o duoi muc do. MOI manh nha deu co \"mau\": [1.9, 1.85, 1.7] - chu du an bao \"nha xam xanh qua\" ngay 18/09. Phai dung `mau` (nhan, giu van hoa tiet) chu KHONG phai `mau_vl`: ca goi City Kit chi co DUNG MOT material ten `colormap`, nen `mau_vl` son het ca nha lan mai lan cua so, khong tach duoc. Ba so lech nhau la co y: keo mau khoi phia xanh lam.",
  "ghi_chu_trang": "Me nay xep gon hon me trung co (77,3% mot trang o co 2x) nhung PHAI ra dung so trang nhu no, khong thi `DoiMeAtlas` nem loi luc len doi. Tu 19/09 me trung co can hai trang o 2x vi ba khung coi xay, nen o day dem mot trang rong. Trang dem ghi 1x1 trong suot - khong ton bo nho GPU, khong sprite nao tro vao.",
